@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | Data retirement review
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify resource, requested action and actor;
if (Applicable authority established?) then (yes)
 :Identify references, submitted copies and dependent data;
 if (Lifecycle policy and consequences decided?) then (yes)
  :Evaluate retention, access and recovery constraints;
  if (Action eligible under agreed policy?) then (yes)
   :Perform only the authorized bounded operation;
   if (Required completion conditions met?) then (yes)
    :Record actual outcome and defined accounting effects; <<#173B34>>
   else (partial / failed)
    :Record incomplete outcome and recovery / retry needs; <<#49351C>>
   endif
  else (no)
   :Do not perform ineligible removal; <<#49351C>>
  endif
 else (pending)
  :Record policy gap for owner review; <<#49351C>>
 endif
else (no)
 :Deny protected operation without disclosure; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Expose only the permitted truthful outcome;
stop
floating note right
Conceptual decision roadmap, not an implemented deletion process.
Unlink, archive, logical deletion and physical reclamation differ.
No retention period, cascade, cleanup job or restore guarantee is selected.
end note
@enduml
